00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:10.060
something changes in our relationship to the environment. These can be the most lethal.

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:21.270
Around the world, few things are feared as much as outbreaks of diseases which kill swiftly

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:30.000
and can appear anywhere, anytime. Such was the case in New Mexico. On May 14th,

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:36.560
